      "decision": "proposePrintedDageshAndRetireSourceNote",
      "finding": "Below the full yod head, the left contour recedes and then expands into a distinct rounded low-left lobe beside the continuing right tail. The literal first pointed yod of paired15 vayaviu has the same fused lower-left branch; the later plain yod and local ordinary yods in yehi, hayu and nasheyhem instead narrow into their right tails. The detached interior point in vayatsigehu36 independently locates the dagesh. The whole contour defeats the ordinary-tail competitor without relying on a white hole or expected spelling. Append U+05BC after the existing U+05B5 tsere; preserve all earlier scalar order."
    }
